[{"title":"闻卢君伯垠冤系京狱作诗吊之","author":"吴曾徯","text":"鲁狱囚公冶，梁都走范雎。\n艰贞随乱世，忧辱况同时。\n旧梦迎桃叶，新愁系柳枝。\n何年人并辔，春色逐归骑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20847,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭亡友陈君狱仙一首","author":"吴曾徯","text":"丈夫谁不死，一死竟何名。\n麡角非时出，鸿毛落地轻。\n豪疑湖海气，交乏劝规情。\n春草茫茫绿，无端哭贾生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20848,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"思故乡亡友韦君泳波不已作诗一首以志恸","author":"吴曾徯","text":"桐死飞么凤，松枯误鹤雏。\n落花春黯淡，宿草墓荒芜。\n时论疑无鬼，交情负托孤。\n十年真一梦，遗恨满江湖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20849,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"汉皋思爱女福官作寄沪上","author":"吴曾徯","text":"东南佳山水，姑苏得八九。\n吴江清淑气，蔚为凤麟薮。\n爱女仅八龄，生时文在手。\n眉语逗犀心，美容夺螓首。\n母授千字文，琅琅皆上口。\n秀外而慧中，怀琼兼佩玖。\n慰我伯道悲，喜嗣中郎后。\n吾家千里驹，巾帼得未有。\n同车加诸胶，同席依我肘。\n起早朝问寝，归迟夜相守。\n承欢胜儿郎，不复离左右。\n愧我罹涸辙，风尘事奔走。\n去时女送爷，江禽啼绿柳。\n今日爷思女，池花开红藕。\n开关历春夏，沪汉隔牛斗。\n皎月出晴川，青天净无垢。\n此情当此夕，浇愁藉歌酒。\n腰细楚女轻，利屣湘娥丑。\n何如我娇见，翘然世无偶。\n问渠何为然，精华蕴郁久。\n体泉源自洁，灵芝根独厚。\n山泽生龙蛇，是女有是母。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20850,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"汉皋寄怀沪上阿姨胡子贞作","author":"吴曾徯","text":"黄鹄摩燕云，失雄自朔北。\n南翔哺雏凤，蔚成毛五色。\n吾家有孀姨，秉心本渊塞。\n藐孤芜我妻，半生瘁心力。\n茕茕吊形影，嗷嗷受卵翼。\n黄金手挥尽，明珠光难匿。\n艳色人间重，蛾眉世所惑。\n群盗势汹汹，将欲掠弱息。\n力作障风幡，手刃劫花贼。\n芙蓉出污泥，依然亭亭植。\n卓哉女专诸，风尘赏奇特。\n射屏赘李渊，逐臣怜苏轼。\n自惭归无家，何以堪倾国。\n蛟龙失云雨，鸾凤困枳棘。\n累他巾帼雄，藜羹不糁食。\n女杰岂可负，佳人难再得。\n仗策走江汉，冀得效一职。\n珠还合浦中，人归锦江侧。\n惜无虬髯知，空有昆崙忆。\n书剑仍飘零，风烈想闺阁。\n令女厉贞操，庄姜美正直。\n女界有仪型，庶为天下则。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20851,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"挽宣化李烈女","author":"缪烜","text":"宣城有女堪励俗，生长闺中严自束。\n针线惟勤继晷灯，陌阡不涉寻春足。\n守贞待字怜里争，交口相称遍亲属。\n前村鼓乐庆秋登，父母偕行俾处独。\n习惯徒知往赛神，疏防倏已来戎伏。\n空庭长日阒无人，啖者视为几上肉。\n乘卢淩弱横相干，兽心乃在常佣仆。\n仓猝奚奔号莫应，此身可死不可辱。\n恨漫碧落气烛虹，爪裂奸容奸手毒。\n石点纷纷星雨飞，血洒桃花躯洁玉。\n身躯玉洁志冰清，二九春光逝水轻，纲常巾帼千秋名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20852,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画鹰赠达将军萧庵","author":"缪烜","text":"由来劲气禀金方，风力霜毛搏击强。\n万里秋心凭绘取，将军英武震要荒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20853,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日至泰山观水磨即事口占","author":"缪烜","text":"花明柳暗别成村，谁逞机心截水根。\n溟海飞涛浮日月，殷雷挟雨破朝昏。\n山誇幽折窝藏壁，客怪衣冠犬吠门。\n信步不寻来去迹，指迷犹见古风存。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20854,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春寒独酌喜友过访","author":"缪烜","text":"怨春红艳冷，细雨湿流光。\n嫩蝶牵愁梦，娇莺懒整簧。\n鸭炉偎宿火，梅帐恋馀香。\n且莫登楼望，相逢各尽觞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20855,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阙题","author":"缪烜","text":"尔乃浣纱女，胡不遇范蠡。\n可怜倾国貌，只有镜相知。\n氓之蚩蚩匹，闻见安所鄙。\n如入吴王宫，未必非祸水。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20856,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有去志","author":"缪烜","text":"人生求适意，不若居家庭。\n家庭难久居，驱车更扬舲。\n经途有夷险，涉水分渭泾。\n而况人心杂，不同如面形。\n道乖遭眼白，气合亦眼青。\n喜不伴君王，君王恐逆鳞。\n远兹势利场，势利多膻腥。\n坚贞秉吾素，淡泊自芳馨。\n避色复避言，遐哉穷入溟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20857,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"折柳二首 其一","author":"缪烜","text":"旗亭驿馆遍毵毵，攀折无端一再三。\n送者自归行者去，人原如此物何堪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20858,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"折柳二首 其二","author":"缪烜","text":"欲寄相思折柳枝，柳枝果否繫相思。\n人间本自轻离别，翻使柳枝重别离。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20859,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忽有所感","author":"缪烜","text":"寒梅小别隔重雪，花事愔愔过几分。\n判得雨声闻昨夜，饱看山色到斜曛。\n春江旧梦潮痕暖，芳草閒愁客思纷。\n毕竟东风能烂漫，行歌陌上见红裙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20860,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏折枝海棠","author":"缪烜","text":"春风著意匀脂粉，绰约真如处女时。\n最好胆瓶斜卧处，一枝没骨写徐熙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20861,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏早行","author":"缪烜","text":"晓上征骖月半斜，居人未起露沈沙。\n雨鸠南北隐相唤，浓绿香来清胜花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20862,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叔孙通","author":"缪烜","text":"江山甫定争群雄，酒酣拔剑日论功。\n若曹非礼不能束，乃公谩骂真瞢瞢。\n试为绵蕞习其易，肃敬先徵长乐宫。\n今日方知天子贵，叔孙无愧名曰通。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20863,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼流民","author":"缪烜","text":"河南癸酉罹天殃，早魃为虐农事伤。\n树皮剥尽草根绝，民生无计多流亡。\n偏遭河北纷寇贼，烽火薰天涂路塞。\n十室九室断爨烟，扶携何处堪求食。\n陌上流民接踵来，肌肤枯槁筋骸摧。\n陌下饥民尸枕籍，兽蹄鸟迹处尘埃。\n陌上回头见陌下，半晌吞声泪频洒。\n玉石至此诚无分，翻悔离家死横野。\n兹闻圣主布深仁，发帑给粟振尔民。\n可怜仁人谷，难入死者腹。\n可怜仁人恩，难返死者魂。\n噫嘻乎悲哉！\n生民不幸值此荒。\n我行见之恻衷肠，愿天早以甘霖降。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20864,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏晋邓攸","author":"缪烜","text":"携侄弃儿行，此心对天地。\n追及树繫之，义至仁不至。\n天道岂无知，买妾遭亲谊。\n伤哉所弃儿，懊哉遂斩嗣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20865,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜读","author":"缪烜","text":"铩羽归来叹索居，侯门寄食漫踟躇。\n笑他浊酒瓶长罄，雨冷灯微读汉书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20866,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日郊行见野菊独茂","author":"缪烜","text":"众芳皆摧隤，篱落忽相见。\n无力仗东风，幽然舒冷艳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20867,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"友人下第客中，邀为长夜之饮，即席口号慰之","author":"缪烜","text":"邀君欢，劝君酒，南山月上大如斗。\n座中谁者苦思家，举杯忘在天之涯。\n傥来富贵恨不早，提壶且乐风光好。\n多疑黄河之水天上来漫漫，饮如渴骥奔驰千里临急湍。\n君醉歌，我醉舞。\n醉歌金石裂，醉舞鸾鹄举。\n鸾鹄一举千万里，蠢蠢浮浮尽眼底。\n劝君酒，邀君欢，东方日出圆如盘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20868,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自慨寄刘大司农信芳","author":"缪烜","text":"越云燕树等闲过，枉负栽培愧琢磨。\n怕听桓伊三弄笛，年来只自唤如何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20869,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"思归","author":"缪烜","text":"隋珠和璞嗟无识，鸡肋蝇头笑不恒。\n枉负春秋饶胜日，最难风雨饯良朋。\n故园松菊怀元亮，乡味莼鲈羡季鹰。\n得计买山甘小隐，如城书拥酒如渑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20870,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"不眠","author":"缪烜","text":"朔饥欲死羡侏儒，生未逢辰笑丈夫。\n夜半不眠时露立，恒星灼灼艳如珠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20871,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读江介臣明府抚字灾黎道中即事诗，忆去岁走乱即和原韵","author":"缪烜","text":"民居寥落不成村，天道人心且莫论。\n我亦被兵几失路，一鞭残照过夷门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20872,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"缪烜","text":"丝桐空抚知音杳，美人迟暮悲芳草。\n迢迢退阁烛光凉，漏静月明花梦悄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20873,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋暖","author":"缪烜","text":"丽晴蛱蝶粉衣匀，疏竹閒花一径新。\n淡客不来帘毕静，午窗诗梦暖于春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20874,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"规友","author":"缪烜","text":"忆君时接梦中魂，昨识沈酣北海尊。\n乌纵忘机难止幕，兰虽抱馥忌当门。\n无妨把剪裁云样，莫便携锄属月痕。\n记取秣陵秋色好，一编对榻细评论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20875,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贫女","author":"缪烜","text":"如此韶光剧可怜，只凭压线度流年。\n羡他墙外閒桃李，也到春来一逞妍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20876,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无花","author":"缪烜","text":"客里无花不算春，无花也自醒迷因。\n惜他风雨勤调护，看到飘零更损神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20877,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"六言二首 其一","author":"缪烜","text":"充义必求至极，泯情先绝二三。\n于陵不如蚯蚓，柳下未若鲁男。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20878,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"六言二首 其二","author":"缪烜","text":"两两三三断续，树果田瓜自落。\n今日假书游目，明日还书空腹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20879,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"牡丹","author":"缪烜","text":"国色天香春满亭，清平三调谱宫伶。\n近来词赋无人识，莫便疏狂学酒星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20880,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春尽日二首 其一","author":"缪烜","text":"客里无端又一春，落红庭院草成茵。\n年来闭户凭春去，春去留连怕损神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20881,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春尽日二首 其二","author":"缪烜","text":"才见春来春可怜，可怜又展送春笺。\n含毫别有閒枨触，不惜青春惜少年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20882,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉中吟","author":"缪烜","text":"绿阴深处听提壶，且醉村醪一再沽。\n情似落花真洒脱，梦如时事半模糊。\n淮阴漫把老渔钓，燕市閒寻旧狗屠。\n川泳云飞观自在，阮生何必哭穷途。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20883,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"放歌","author":"缪烜","text":"丈夫未遇虎如狗，南北东西牛马走。\n沈枯一室若逃禅，游戏百函聊糊口。\n虽知混迹在泥涂，不敢随风等杞柳。\n閒心漾漾出岫云，浩气英英互星斗。\n自食其力同工商，屋漏不愧古人友。\n怜他蠢蠢与浮浮，不识天高并地厚。\n呼马呼牛皆应之，丈夫未遇虎如狗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20884,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新正初四喜见新月","author":"缪烜","text":"新月西南挂一钩，饮馀当户喜抬头。\n莫言宝鉴初探匣，已见清光遍九州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20885,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即事口占","author":"缪烜","text":"强将浊酒涤烦襟，聚散无端慨盍簪。\n独立斜阳情一往，满庭飞絮又春深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20886,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"追感前事复呈一律","author":"缪烜","text":"每因文字结深缘，大匠知无弃短椽。\n越水吴山陪岁岁，燕南赵北挈年年。\n金沙细拣心常切，廉俸频分惠独先。\n尤幸姓名今不没，凭公怀赠到瑶编。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20887,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"顾郑乡过访不值","author":"缪烜","text":"不甘贫贱老延陵，每逐京华逸骥腾。\n茶酒味清情易引，尖叉韵险步难胜。\n漫言待嫁贞于女，且托逃禅懒若僧。\n风雪锁窗欣过访，多君元著自超乘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20888,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读汉姜肱传","author":"缪烜","text":"彭城姜伯淮，五十始慕学。\n六艺皆穷通，声名遂卓卓。\n我今年已几，犹然未镌琢。\n可不急困勉，以与前贤角。\n岂羡买臣荣，欲如伯玉觉。\n闻昔兰陵合，荀卿惠民渥。\n我乃兰陵人，蓬庐谨守璞。\n世若有知人，无妨一驰逐。\n势利遂长年，且自乐其乐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20889,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻予规","author":"缪烜","text":"得笋复得虾，谢豹来何遽。\n我更不伤春，莫便催春去。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20890,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读史","author":"缪烜","text":"文君真知音，私奔司马氏。\n阮籍真好色，邻家恸处子。\n惟此真之中，邪正亦倍蓰。\n然宁侧其冠，不必纳其履。\n刑罚可失出，褒贬腌逼里。\n历观史传中，竞艳每书此。\n一时爱其才，春秋紊大旨。\n且令炫才者，越礼有所指。\n风俗自兹靡，责归作俑始。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20891,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶咏","author":"缪烜","text":"春风本无心，开花任红白。\n红白不坚贞，风飘委阡陌。\n倩树护花幡，谋设当风帟。\n灼灼矜春光，幡帟倏然摘。\n风自行其常，花遂失其魄。\n人皆怨风狂，我不为花惜。\n凡物贵自强，凭依究何益。\n如以言之非，试与观松柏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20892,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"及门孔义韩问橘过淮而变枳，未识枳返淮而仍橘否喜其心思灵活，书此广之","author":"缪烜","text":"橘过淮变枳，土易性随失。\n未闻枳返淮，可以复成橘。\n偶缘子质疑，恍起予载笔。\n宁惟物乖常，而人亦莫必。\n秦桧伯夷颂，居然伊周匹。\n钤山堂十年，冰雪志士律。\n一朝利禄萦，顿改庐中质。\n所以圣贤尊，终始守贞一。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20893,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有感","author":"缪烜","text":"杨柳垂丝草展茵，羊昙西醉过州堙。\n低徊许子凄凉句，侬与将军是故人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20894,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶感","author":"缪烜","text":"南山有松柏，茑萝附其根。\n植体虽不同，相依朝与昏。\n缠干复牵枝，保此真质存。\n美哉伯夷传，所喻乃名言。\n苍蝇集骥尾，万里得腾奔。\n颜贤失孔圣，胡能到今尊。\n士贵识所托，终始无翩翻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20895,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"见有构鹤付力人担负而至者，一死于途，一死于宅。数语伤之","author":"缪烜","text":"蓬莱羽士尊禽族，点缀园林珍众畜。\n何来负腹一将军，也附风人构说目。\n不乘轩舆不艇浮，担头束缚同鸡鹜。\n嗟哉胫折并翎摧，化去后先止隔宿。\n尔虽愿学丁今仙，我还欲效唐衢哭。\n杀风景笑类焚琴，呜呼，谁其瘗尔焦山麓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20896,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郡中舟返四绝 其一","author":"缪烜","text":"欸乃一声幽，两岸浮众绿。\n风来水面馨，诗怀不自束。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20897,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郡中舟返四绝 其二","author":"缪烜","text":"薄醉敞襟坐，桑麻话舟子。\n桥低压过篷，一鸟惊飞起。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20898,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郡中舟返四绝 其三","author":"缪烜","text":"一郭又一村，行行皆画意。\n悬罾坐老渔，知是待潮至。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20899,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郡中舟返四绝 其四","author":"缪烜","text":"夜气如此清，水阔沙不碍。\n远火逗深林，村龙相间吠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20900,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"出门口占","author":"缪烜","text":"书剑无成学两违，论交偏自慎脂韦。\n饥蚕乙乙待人饲，野鹤丁丁何处飞。\n的皪冰心原是净，伶俜诗骨不能肥。\n蹇驴驮我出门去，太息荆州已掩帏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20901,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶占","author":"缪烜","text":"拣金当披沙，采兰当披榛。\n我来沙榛区，拣采良艰辛。\n其如鉴赏者，犹豫狐疑频。\n金仍委之涧，兰仍杂之薪。\n不伤金兰屈，转幸沙榛伸。\n因悟世间事，无为认太真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20902,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"平定州道中","author":"缪烜","text":"十年寒偏烈，天空落木前。\n乱山晴插雪，小店野含烟。\n丹杮沿村卖，黄梁比户研。\n江南春信早，约到岭梅边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20903,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登平阳试院后平台","author":"缪烜","text":"春草饱雨青，春树摇风绿。\n院后一废台，暇登仗童仆。\n屋瓦合层层，市阛通曲曲。\n西穹姑射山，云有仙人躅。\n汾水出其阳，桑麻赖之沃。\n熙熙去来氓，负戴俭成俗。\n遐想此尧封，胸怀真不局。\n苦无贤圣目，高瞻难远瞩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20904,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哺饥坡","author":"缪烜","text":"昨由灵石谒淮阴，等是酬恩国士心。\n闻说哺饥当此坡，翳桑日卓影沈沈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20905,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"接次儿所寄家信，喜而勉之","author":"缪烜","text":"大儿复出门，愁乏书家信。\n家信忽然来，开缄就灯烬。\n认是次儿笔，文理颇明顺。\n先言母氏安，次述年荒馑。\n幸不大摧残，族党皆无衅。\n大姐嫁邻县，其夫旅归榇。\n恐伤老父心，宛转设疑阵。\n小弟少培植，亦肯自精进。\n府县今其试，得覆名尚隽。\n已缘家道艰，往教受人聘。\n童蒙十二三，功课勤而慎。\n缕缕悉成行，固封还密印。\n因欢付小诗，人生当自振。\n勉哉毋懈怠，以作千里骏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20906,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登太行山","author":"缪烜","text":"千里延袤势纵横，当年秦晋此纷争。\n河从远树苍茫见，人向低天咫尺行。\n云顾每思亲舍在，雪飞应苦客车征。\n也因涉险兴徒戒，心一持平路亦平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20907,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行上党山中","author":"缪烜","text":"胜地由来妙迹垂，何年寺渺仅留基。\n閒寻夕照荒榛裹，太息横陈耐辱碑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20908,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塞上即目俚言十首 其一","author":"缪烜","text":"江南杨柳枝，二月枝堪折。\n塞北谷雨过，春光才漏泄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20909,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塞上即目俚言十首 其二","author":"缪烜","text":"杏花开春深，云艳若霞锦。\n我来已飘零，此间推上品。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20910,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]